          "text": "Is she cute?"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Why are you sad?"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Is this mine?"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Are they healthy?"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Is my face green?"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Are these yours?"
        },
        {
